{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cacc22aceeef180db5382498f17b79087d487cc11db966a553e7f10a786951a3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7c00514085b3229757cbbd124ef9ad3922eaf81de69935aefb42a25aa9ef069",
      "text": "早上好，制作人。\n今天是今年最后的工作了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad94f1ff6ba94e920ec01a4a45525369b3904703c35ae2d90b0e55ae186c3f9d",
      "text": "倒也不是顺便，\n只是想先跟你说一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aedb922e2c53eb67ebdb0ab300d14cc12e6dd4fc6021cdd89c7839b29209fc1",
      "text": "那个，今年受了你很多照顾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f1be7dfcb09c354478237d48256bdacd9dd7d1744aa2354fc9a9bb041c8b2e5",
      "text": "虽然和你相遇之后，\n其实并没有过去太久，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aa890845a38488bdbfd80c7fe140b55db3a60421e9a4988dafbf57db00356e1",
      "text": "但回想起来，脑海里全是你照顾我的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e86cb05a8a91feed08ddaa4dffead5ec1e225c78a24905a8f5e8239c9336dd3",
      "text": "哪里的话！我才是一直受到您的照顾！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:657e0bfe650b47d6200b9de1e345fa3feb92feca1a7ecdb1671c771622a606c7",
      "text": "武先生也帮了我很多忙",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bf2b58e842a8169233140dcd9ae6e426fbf6078a2d24595f9238ea62bdafe12",
      "text": "哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a45117eb0993523d7300167f90e61c8e9c8cca0b4ab4a0843e1163aa2746580",
      "text": "……抱歉，你说的话完全不出我所料，\n忍不住笑出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_401_2_4_038_01_09_a:2_4_038_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:133cc428011671a5aa374cdccfc2be7762827e13ba69419136ce99038eaa2efd",
      "text": "为了给明年开个好头，今天的工作我也\n绝对会办得漂漂亮亮的。那就晚点在电视台见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
